Decision recorded. Report-only spike complete.

**Decision (P4.3 project↔document):** A2E Projects owns **both** sides — FK `document.project` M2O on a2e-documents' `_document` object (`SET_NULL`, standalone foreign field) + inverse `project.documents` O2M on its own object. Only the consumer can declare the inverse on the provider's foreign object without forcing Documents to depend on Projects (app-contributed fields on foreign objects are a tested, supported shape).

**Install order:** provider → consumer (Documents before Projects); no manifest app-dependency declaration exists, so onboarding's array order / manual install must enforce it. Installing Projects first aborts atomically with "relation target object metadata not found" (accounting 0.1.0 precedent). **Uninstall** is reverse and already enforced by C3's `ApplicationUninstallPreflightService.computeCrossAppDependents`/`assertUninstallAllowed` — no new preflight.

